      "amount": "1/2 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Rinse the barramundi fillets and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped candied orange peel, lemon juice, thyme, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the brine dried tomatoes and cook for 2 minutes, until they start to soften.",
    "Add the barramundi fillets to the skillet, skin side up, and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 12 minutes, until the fish is cooked through."
